@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Sprint Planning and Backlog Management";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <p class="lead text-center">Effective sprint planning and backlog management are essential for Agile teams to deliver value efficiently.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">What is Sprint Planning?</h2>
        <p>
            Sprint Planning is a crucial event in Agile Scrum where the team decides the work to be completed in the next sprint. The goal is to ensure that the selected backlog items align with business priorities and team capacity.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/sprint-planning.jpg" alt="Sprint Planning" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Sprint planning helps teams define clear goals for the sprint.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Backlog Management -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">What is Backlog Management?</h2>
        <p>
            Backlog Management involves organizing, refining, and prioritizing tasks in the product backlog. The backlog contains user stories, features, and bug fixes that need to be worked on in future sprints.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Prioritization:</strong> Ensuring the most valuable work is completed first.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Grooming:</strong> Refining backlog items to ensure clarity and feasibility.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration:</strong> Regular input from stakeholders to align priorities.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/backlog-management.jpg" alt="Backlog Management" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Backlog refinement helps teams maintain a well-structured workflow.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sprint Planning Steps -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">Steps in Sprint Planning</h2>
        <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
            <li class="list-group-item">Review product backlog and prioritize tasks.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Define the sprint goal based on business needs.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Break down selected backlog items into tasks.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Estimate effort and assign work to team members.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Finalize the sprint backlog and begin execution.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/sprint-steps.jpg" alt="Sprint Planning Steps" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Following structured steps ensures successful sprint execution.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Best Practices -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Best Practices for Sprint Planning & Backlog Management</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Define Clear Goals:</strong> Set a clear objective for each sprint.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Keep Backlog Organized:</strong> Regularly groom backlog items to ensure clarity.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Encourage Collaboration:</strong> Involve the entire team in sprint planning discussions.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Use Agile Tools:</strong> Utilize Azure DevOps, Jira, or other Agile tools for backlog tracking.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/sprint-best-practices.jpg" alt="Best Practices" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Applying best practices enhances sprint efficiency and outcomes.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-secondary">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Effective sprint planning and backlog management are crucial to Agile success. By prioritizing tasks, refining backlog items, and following structured sprint planning steps, teams can improve productivity and deliver value consistently.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/sprint-conclusion.jpg" alt="Conclusion" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Mastering sprint planning ensures smooth Agile workflows.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
